  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At noon in the KBS staff cafeteria, Kim Tae-ho hands out lunch coupons and boasts that passing pop stars all know him well. Listen for the expressions for 'the food is delicious' and 'I had no idea'.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "이게 하나에 사천 원씩인데.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "여기 밥 맛있어.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "두 개씩 먹어도 돼요?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "먹어!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "사람 모이면 귀찮으니까 조용히 밥이나 먹자.",
