      "t": "두 개씩 먹어도 돼요?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'May I eat two of these?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "먹어!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go ahead and eat!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "사람 모이면 귀찮으니까 조용히 밥이나 먹자.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's a hassle if a crowd gathers, so let's just eat quietly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "친하십니까?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you close with them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "아, 친하다뿐이냐!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, close doesn't even cover it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "전혀 몰랐어요.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They didn't know him at all.'",
      "gap": 0.65
